{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10333","headline":"和崔二少府登楚丘城作 · 高适","name":"和崔二少府登楚丘城作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故人亦不遇，异县久栖托。\n辛勤失路意，感叹登楼作。\n清晨眺原野，独立穷寥廓。\n云散芒砀山，水还睢阳郭。\n绕梁即襟带，封卫多漂泊。\n事古悲城池，年丰爱墟落。\n相逢俱未展，携手空萧索。\n何意千里心，仍求百金诺。\n公侯皆我辈，动用在谋略。\n圣心思贤才，朅来刈葵藿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}